                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "Network traffic must be monitored continuously and anomalies must be investigated within 4 hours"
              },
              {
                "id": "POL-NS-001_gdn",
                "name": "guidance",
                "prose": "This section defines network segmentation and monitoring requirements.\nNetwork traffic must be monitored continuously and anomalies must be investigated within 4 hours\nFirewalls must be configured to deny all traffic by default and allow only explicitly authorized connections\nIntrusion detection systems must be deployed at all network boundaries per NIST SP 800-94"
              }
            ],
