                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "All policy exceptions must be documented and approved by the CISO"
              },
              {
                "id": "POL-CA-004_gdn",
                "name": "guidance",
                "prose": "This section defines compliance monitoring and audit requirements per ISO 27001.\nInternal security audits must be conducted at least annually\nThird-party penetration testing must be performed semi-annually and findings must be remediated within 30 days\nCompliance reports must be submitted to the board of directors quarterly\nAll policy exceptions must be documented and approved by the CISO and must expire within 12 months"
              }
            ],
